{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">SUPER function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310766","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/SUPER-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/SUPER-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"SUPER-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">SUPER function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SUPER-function__section_N10037_N10034_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Runs the super procedure version of the current user-defined\nfunction.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This language element must appear within a user-defined\nfunction, but can appear anywhere within the user-defined function.\nIf this language element does not appear within a user-defined function,\nthe compiler reports an error.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SUPER-function__syntax_GC1B19J2704576\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d258501e110\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"SUPER-function__idGDP2ZA2677098\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>SUPER <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">...</strong>  ) <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter </var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">A parameter of the super version of the current user-defined function.\nThese parameters must have the same signature (number of parameters,\nand type and mode of each) as the parameters of the current user-defined\nfunction. You can, however, adjust a parameter&#39;s value.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">For\nthe <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var> syntax, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Parameter-definition-syntax.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Parameter-definition-syntax.html\">Parameter definition syntax</a> reference entry.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">If a user-defined function\ncannot be located in any super procedure, the AVM generates the\nfollowing error message:</p>\n            <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"SUPER-function__idGDP2ZB2677109\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n                  <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                      <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>SUPER version of user-defined function <var class=\"keyword varname\">name</var> invoked but could not be found</code></pre>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n            <p class=\"p\">Errors are stored in the ERROR-STATUS handle\nwhen NO-ERROR is specified.</p>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SUPER-function__example_GC1B19K2704587\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d258501e214\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">For\nan example of the SUPER function, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RUN-SUPER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RUN-SUPER-statement.html\">RUN SUPER statement</a> reference\nentry.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SUPER-function__notes_GC1B19M2704593\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d258501e227\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">To\nrun the super version of an internal procedure, use the RUN SUPER\nstatement.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For the rules that ABL uses to find the super version of the\ncurrent user-defined function, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ADD-SUPER-PROCEDURE-method.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ADD-SUPER-PROCEDURE-method.html\">ADD-SUPER-PROCEDURE( ) method</a> reference entry. </li>\n      </ul>\n  \n      \n    \n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SUPER-function__see-also_GC1B19N2704601\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d258501e246\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ADD-SUPER-PROCEDURE-method.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ADD-SUPER-PROCEDURE-method.html\">ADD-SUPER-PROCEDURE( ) method</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"REMOVE-SUPER-PROCEDURE-method.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/REMOVE-SUPER-PROCEDURE-method.html\">REMOVE-SUPER-PROCEDURE( ) method</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RUN-SUPER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RUN-SUPER-statement.html\">RUN SUPER statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SOURCE-PROCEDURE-system-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SOURCE-PROCEDURE-system-handle.html\">SOURCE-PROCEDURE system handle</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SUPER-PROCEDURES-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SUPER-PROCEDURES-attribute.html\">SUPER-PROCEDURES attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TARGET-PROCEDURE-system-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TARGET-PROCEDURE-system-handle.html\">TARGET-PROCEDURE system handle</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SUBSTRING-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SUBSTRING-statement.html\">SUBSTRING statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SUPER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SUPER-statement.html\">SUPER statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310766","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"SUPER function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SUPER-function.html","type":"Manual"}